    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d69">

                <pb facs="0214" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg844"/>

                <head>No. 375.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General <persName corresp="#p_DES1"
                            type="from">Sickles</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1"
                            type="to">Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-01-18"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 18,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Conference to-day with ministers of state and ultramar respecting embargoed
                    estates. It was agreed that the latter cable, captain-general of Cuba, and the
                    former cable, Admiral <persName>Polo</persName>, authorizing and directing them
                    to act in relation to pending cases and enjoining dispatch in their proceeding.
                    Minister of state expressed surprise and regret at continued delay in cases of
                    Mora, Mueses, Hernandez, Criado, and Mrs. Mora.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_DES1">SICKLES</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
